codex
The implementation stores `left/right` as `[B*H, N, N]` and delegates the N³ part to `torch.bmm`, so the triangular update itself is already using cuBLAS. I’m going to build a small local timing harness for the published cases to see which shapes dominate and which kernels are worth changing.
